{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Pig Named Munika: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja30'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 30 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Kuruṅgavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Four-horned Antelope </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>10. Munikajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Pig Named Munika: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Mā munikassa pihayi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Envy not what is Munika’s, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>āturannāni bhuñjati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>for he eats the food of the terminally ill. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Appossukko bhusaṁ khāda, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Don’t worry, just eat your chaff, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>etaṁ dīghāyulakkhaṇan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>this is a mark of long life. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Munikajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>Kuruṅgavaggo tatiyo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kuruṅgassa kukkuragojavaro, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Puna vāḷavassasirivhayano; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Mahiḷāmukhanāmanuññavaro, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vahate dhura munikena dasāti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
